@startuml
title Current subflow control loop
skinparam shadowing false
actor Human
participant "Host Agent / Navigate" as Agent
participant "ARSU producer" as ARSU
participant "Verify / Decide" as Companion
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
database "Workspace files" as Files
Agent -> CLI : status
CLI -> Files : scan current owners
CLI --> Agent : active instances + selectors
Agent -> CLI : instructions route:<skill>:<mode>
CLI --> Agent : prerequisites, outputs, Gates, cost
Agent -> Human : route summary
Human --> Agent : confirm exact instance
Agent -> CLI : start + semantic input
CLI -> Files : create control + handoff atomically
Agent -> ARSU : bounded semantic work
ARSU -> Files : external deliverable + owning handoff
opt formal Gate
  Agent -> Companion : verify evidence
  Companion -> Human : proposed verdict
  Human --> Companion : confirm verdict
  Companion -> CLI : decide gate:<instance>/<gate>
  CLI -> Files : append Gate attempt to control
end
Agent -> CLI : advance subflow:<instance>
CLI -> Files : validate profile + control + handoff
CLI -> Files : append transition atomically
CLI --> Agent : current status
@enduml
